// FQC1 node: one flat-quant blob (see fq-codec.ts / ply.ts parseFqChunk) → per-splat (pre-flip)
// → emitSlab. Header: "FQC1" + uint32 count + uint32 numSubChunks + float32[numSub*18] bounds +
